{"type": "SentenceBoundary", "offset": 211407772, "duration": 23436893, "text": "This is the scope we carry forward."}
{"type": "SentenceBoundary", "offset": 234844666, "duration": 37606797, "text": "A I feasibility is not assessed against an isolated server."}
